From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 23:45:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(reporter): Color mutant diffs in the GitHub Actions log
 reporter

GitHub Actions logs render ANSI colors, so the text log written to php://stdout
on GitHub Actions now prints removed diff lines in red and added lines in green,
like the CLI does with --show-mutations.

Closes #2582
---
 src/Reporter/BaseTextFileReporter.php         |  7 +-
 .../GitHubActionsLogTextFileReporter.php      | 34 ++++++++++
 .../GitHubActionsLogTextFileReporterTest.php  | 66 +++++++++----------
 3 files changed, 73 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)

